{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:42 2026-11-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:42 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:42 2026-11-12 HKT</p><img alt=\"將軍澳站職員遇襲 遭失控男扯髮打頭 乘客合力助制服\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34005dc4a1f85212dc55d06a0b4f77c6/2026-11/collage_56.jpg\"/><p>將軍澳港鐵站內，今日（11月12日）晚上7時許，一名男職員在站內遭人襲擊流鼻血，多名熱心乘客見狀，協助制服失控男子。警方接報後到場跟進，事發原因仍在調查。</p><p>網上片段所見，當時身穿黑衫的男子，失控拉住一名港鐵男職員，向對方狂扯頭髮及揮拳打頭，另一職員試圖拉開雙方不果，大批市民圍觀嘩聲四起，又不斷大叫「唔好打啦」。所幸多名熱心乘客見狀上前，眾人合力將掙扎男子制服在地。其後大批其他職員到場支援，未幾警方亦到場調查，為失控男子上手銬。</p><img alt=\"現場為將軍澳港鐵站內。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78bdd2c13cdf539117fb41be7d5647fc/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h29m50s841.png\"/><img alt=\"黑衫男子失控襲擊港鐵職員，向對方狂扯髮及打頭。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17b769acb636eb6197bde1643a462c69/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h29m57s345.png\"/><img alt=\"黑衫男子失控襲擊港鐵職員，向對方狂扯髮及打頭。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/efad252ed2926e1711f77fad0686dded/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h30m16s149.png\"/><img alt=\"熱心乘客上前，協助制服失控男子。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad2ecb9ab6d1ab1e079f24c7a2a8ed2d/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h30m45s179.png\"/><img alt=\"熱心乘客上前，協助制服失控男子。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f4f6e3b82870925ccc3cd8c8ad04254/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h30m57s113.png\"/><img alt=\"眾人合力將掙扎男子制服地上。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ea81ac00f84822b8f71bb6f2eb1df3e/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h31m02s574.png\"/><img alt=\"眾人合力將掙扎男子制服地上。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ba0a9b25af5530b50e72601f2da9820/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h31m12s770.png\"/><img alt=\"大批其他職員到場支援。Threads：joy.122310\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2645b082360a2eeb8da3d1b6a68a3169/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h31m25s340.png\"/><img alt=\"警員到場接手，向失控男子上手銬。Threads：tse_chungho820\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2567023444fc821ae18f859ff06cf9fd/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-12-20h31m44s436.png\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:03:53.198130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:42:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:57:24.700777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:57:24.700777+00:00","content_hash":"c3206810f83a46cc282d15b8468e25400a18b1de38b90c1b65f0a980a1e4cf44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}